WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 6=

22
01:59.895 --> 02:00.416
Mr. Tian.

23
02:03.216 --> 02:03.696
Liren.

24
02:04.175 --> 02:04.696
Good day, Mr. Tian.

25
02:05.416 --> 02:07.696
You've lost weight since I last saw you.

26
02:08.536 --> 02:09.856
You must be joking, Mr. Tian.

27
02:10.256 --> 02:11.175
We just met last month.

28
02:11.296 --> 02:11.976
It's too soon.

29
02:13.175 --> 02:13.615
But

30
02:13.895 --> 02:14.536
that golf club

31
02:14.576 --> 02:15.495
you took me to

32
02:15.615 --> 02:16.175
was great.

33
02:16.536 --> 02:17.215
I got a membership.

34
02:17.576 --> 02:18.215
Let's go again.

35
02:18.455 --> 02:18.816
Sure.

36
02:19.935 --> 02:21.376
How is your mother doing?

37
02:21.735 --> 02:23.215
Amazing doctor you recommended.

38
02:23.576 --> 02:24.376
Before him,

39
02:24.536 --> 02:25.696
everyone was saying

40
02:25.775 --> 02:26.576
there was no hope.

41
02:27.335 --> 02:29.296
But Director Zhao dared

42
02:29.416 --> 02:30.016
to operate.

43
02:31.055 --> 02:32.055
She's pulling through.

44
02:33.296 --> 02:33.816
Meng.

45
02:34.816 --> 02:36.096
You married the right man.

46
02:36.576 --> 02:37.016
So reliable.

47
02:39.296 --> 02:40.455
Long time no see, Mr. Tian.

48
02:40.696 --> 02:41.055
Right.

49
02:41.376 --> 02:42.416
I know you and Mr. Dong

50
02:42.495 --> 02:42.976
love crab,

51
02:43.256 --> 02:43.816
so I got some

52
02:43.935 --> 02:44.976
top-quality king crabs.

53
02:45.136 --> 02:46.296
I'll get them to your car.

54
02:46.576 --> 02:47.696
Meng is always thoughtful.

55
02:47.696 --> 02:49.096
She remembers what we like.

56
02:49.376 --> 02:50.096
Of course I do.

57
02:50.895 --> 02:52.175
I can't enjoy them, though.

58
02:52.376 --> 02:53.215
Liren knows.

59
02:53.455 --> 02:54.335
I just had a checkup,

60
02:54.495 --> 02:55.976
and my uric acid is high.

61
02:56.256 --> 02:56.696
So,

62
02:57.096 --> 02:58.735
no more seafood for me.

63
02:59.215 --> 02:59.536
Yeah,

64
02:59.775 --> 03:00.495
you have to

65
03:00.735 --> 03:01.576
watch your diet.

66
03:02.536 --> 03:03.215
I know

67
03:03.215 --> 03:04.136
a nutritionist.

68
03:04.816 --> 03:05.455
I'll ask him

69
03:05.495 --> 03:06.136
for a meal plan.

70
03:07.215 --> 03:07.536
Right.

71
03:08.096 --> 03:08.976
How is your dad?

72
03:09.455 --> 03:09.735
The same...

73
03:09.735 --> 03:10.376
Let's talk

74
03:10.655 --> 03:11.215
on the way.

75
03:11.495 --> 03:11.816
Let's go.

76
03:15.455 --> 03:17.136
I heard you got hurt a while ago.

77
03:18.536 --> 03:19.296
It's nothing.

78
03:20.215 --> 03:20.696
Meng,

79
03:21.416 --> 03:22.335
you must take good care

80
03:22.335 --> 03:23.175
of Liren.

81
03:23.495 --> 03:24.856
He's the pillar of this family.

82
03:25.495 --> 03:26.136
I will.

83
03:35.536 --> 03:36.816
Here, have some water.

84
03:39.136 --> 03:40.655
No, thanks.

85
03:40.816 --> 03:41.495
What's wrong?

86
03:41.615 --> 03:42.416
Zi,

87
03:42.856 --> 03:44.655
why do I feel the "Li" in Jiali

88
03:46.096 --> 03:48.175
is becoming the "Li" in Di Liren?

89
03:48.175 --> 03:49.016
What do you mean?

90
03:52.976 --> 03:53.536
Listen.

91
03:54.256 --> 03:54.935
I ran into Mr. Tian

92
03:54.976 --> 03:55.856
at the hospital today.

93
03:56.976 --> 03:57.976
It looks like

94
03:58.256 --> 03:58.895
Di Liren

95
03:58.935 --> 04:00.296
is far closer to him

96
04:00.696 --> 04:01.935
than I thought.

97
04:02.895 --> 04:03.935
They look

98
04:04.495 --> 04:05.816
so close to each other.

99
04:06.175 --> 04:07.495
It terrifies me.

100
04:09.055 --> 04:09.735
What if

101
04:09.735 --> 04:11.175
I can't keep Jiali?

102
04:11.576 --> 04:12.576
No way.

103
04:12.935 --> 04:14.655
Your dad is Jiali's biggest shareholder.

104
04:14.856 --> 04:16.016
He holds more shares

105
04:16.256 --> 04:17.215
than Mr. Tian.

106
04:17.335 --> 04:18.696
Once you divorce Di Liren

107
04:18.816 --> 04:19.975
and inherit

108
04:19.975 --> 04:20.816
your dad's shares,

109
04:21.016 --> 04:22.415
Di Liren won't be able

110
04:22.655 --> 04:23.736
to steal Jiali.

111
04:25.975 --> 04:26.936
Actually...

112
04:29.136 --> 04:30.576
You may not get the shares?

113
04:36.095 --> 04:37.616
When my dad and Mr. Tian

114
04:37.975 --> 04:39.256
founded Jiali,

115
04:40.016 --> 04:40.975
to prevent

116
04:40.975 --> 04:42.256
any future disputes,

117
04:42.655 --> 04:44.176
they added a clause

118
04:44.176 --> 04:44.895
to the bylaws.

119
04:45.215 --> 04:45.895
If either of them

120
04:45.975 --> 04:47.256
passes away first,

121
04:47.496 --> 04:49.136
and their children haven't

122
04:49.215 --> 04:50.215
managed the company,

123
04:50.535 --> 04:52.176
the shares can't be inherited.

124
04:53.415 --> 04:54.496
Instead, the shares

125
04:54.855 --> 04:55.936
will automatically transfer

126
04:55.936 --> 04:56.616
to the other

127
04:57.176 --> 04:57.895
shareholders.

128
04:59.535 --> 05:00.775
Does Di Liren own shares?

129
05:02.295 --> 05:03.455
Not yet.

130
05:05.415 --> 05:06.176
But

131
05:06.176 --> 05:07.335
as the company's chairman,

132
05:08.176 --> 05:09.455
he has the preemptive buyback rights.

133
05:11.215 --> 05:12.295
That means trouble.

134
05:12.616 --> 05:13.775
Has your dad never

135
05:13.816 --> 05:14.576
made a will?

136
05:19.016 --> 05:20.016
He always believed

137
05:20.016 --> 05:21.176
he was in great health.

138
05:21.496 --> 05:22.655
If anyone mentioned a will,

139
05:22.736 --> 05:23.775
he thought it was bad luck.

140
05:24.455 --> 05:25.696
I used to think

141
05:26.176 --> 05:27.415
a couple shares everything,

142
05:27.535 --> 05:29.215
including the company, the money...

143
05:29.855 --> 05:30.936
What's yours is mine,

144
05:30.936 --> 05:32.136
and what's mine is yours.

145
05:32.936 --> 05:34.295
But it'd turn out like this.

146
05:36.176 --> 05:37.696
Well then,

147
05:38.056 --> 05:39.295
why not use Jiali

148
05:39.415 --> 05:40.295
as a bargaining chip

149
05:40.295 --> 05:41.215
against Di Liren?

150
05:42.295 --> 05:43.215
No way.

151
05:43.696 --> 05:45.295
This company is my dad's life's work.

152
05:45.655 --> 05:46.576
How can I just

153
05:46.616 --> 05:47.455
hand it over?

154
05:47.736 --> 05:48.335
Besides,

155
05:48.496 --> 05:50.095
I cut my losses

156
05:50.215 --> 05:51.696
because compared to the company,

157
05:51.816 --> 05:53.095
our marital assets

158
05:53.215 --> 05:53.895
are just

159
05:53.936 --> 05:54.936
a drop in the ocean.

160
05:56.376 --> 05:57.376
Calm down.

161
05:57.936 --> 05:59.016
Let's break it down.

162
05:59.295 --> 06:00.535
Do you know

163
06:00.535 --> 06:01.176
how much power

164
06:01.256 --> 06:02.775
he actually holds in the company?

165
06:07.496 --> 06:09.056
I really need to find out.

166
06:09.295 --> 06:10.576
Mrs. Di brought bubble tea

167
06:10.616 --> 06:11.535
for everyone.

168
06:11.655 --> 06:13.496
First come, first served.

169
06:15.655 --> 06:16.415
Come and grab one.

170
06:16.415 --> 06:17.616
Thank you.

171
06:17.895 --> 06:18.576
Take one.

172
06:18.616 --> 06:19.616
Good work, everyone.

173
06:19.816 --> 06:20.535
Pass them out.

174
06:20.535 --> 06:21.295
We've got all flavors.

175
06:21.535 --> 06:22.056
Come on.

176
06:23.736 --> 06:24.576
Let me post this

177
06:24.576 --> 06:25.376
on WeChat Moments.

178
06:25.376 --> 06:25.895
Honey,

179
06:26.535 --> 06:27.215
you didn't tell me

180
06:27.335 --> 06:28.415
you were coming.

181
06:29.016 --> 06:30.535
I wanted to surprise you.

182
06:31.415 --> 06:32.136
Mr. Di.

183
06:32.455 --> 06:33.455
You two are so sweet.

184
06:33.736 --> 06:35.775
You're cleared to leave early today.

185
06:35.936 --> 06:37.176
Careful, or I'll make you work overtime.

186
06:37.696 --> 06:39.496
The boss is mad.

187
06:39.816 --> 06:41.655
- I'm so scared. - I'm so scared.

188
06:41.655 --> 06:42.535
Perfect timing.

189
06:42.696 --> 06:43.455
I have something for you.

190
06:43.616 --> 06:44.056
Wait here.

191
06:45.655 --> 06:46.736
Do we reimburse insulin?

192
06:46.736 --> 06:47.295
Mr. Di.

193
06:47.496 --> 06:48.736
We're getting sugar overdoses.

194
06:49.136 --> 06:51.655
- Way too sweet. - So sweet.

195
06:53.056 --> 06:54.696
(To see his true standing in the company,)

196
06:54.816 --> 06:56.176
(listen to what his employees say.)

197
06:56.376 --> 06:57.376
(You're Mrs. Di.)

198
06:57.696 --> 06:59.176
(No one would badmouth him)

199
06:59.176 --> 07:00.136
(to your face.)

200
07:00.616 --> 07:01.816
(But if you ask,)

201
07:02.176 --> 07:03.136
(and they only offer)

202
07:03.256 --> 07:04.496
(hollow pleasantries,)

203
07:04.775 --> 07:05.816
(it means)

204
07:06.215 --> 07:07.655
(they don't really respect him.)

205
07:10.696 --> 07:11.496
Doesn't he get mad

206
07:11.616 --> 07:12.655
when you talk to him

207
07:12.936 --> 07:13.616
like that?

208
07:13.895 --> 07:15.455
- Not at all. - Never.

209
07:15.576 --> 07:16.816
He never gets mad.

210
07:16.975 --> 07:18.295
He's amazing.

211
07:18.455 --> 07:18.936
Yeah.

212
07:19.215 --> 07:20.295
I was shocked

213
07:20.376 --> 07:22.056
when I saw him at the interview.

214
07:22.455 --> 07:23.816
I'm just an entry-level worker,

215
07:24.056 --> 07:24.816
but the big boss

216
07:24.855 --> 07:26.295
interviewed me in person.

217
07:26.295 --> 07:28.016
When I had a family emergency

218
07:28.095 --> 07:29.176
and couldn't get a ticket,

219
07:29.616 --> 07:30.855
he had someone drive me

220
07:30.936 --> 07:31.936
all the way home.

221
07:32.576 --> 07:33.895
His driver gave me a ride too.

222
07:34.415 --> 07:35.936
Same here.

223
07:37.455 --> 07:37.975
Honey,

224
07:38.215 --> 07:39.775
I got new samples from a partner.

225
07:40.056 --> 07:40.535
Here.

226
07:40.936 --> 07:41.696
Take them home.

227
07:42.095 --> 07:42.576
What is it?

228
07:43.719 --> 07:44.496
(Wishing Mr. Di a booming business.)

229
07:44.496 --> 07:45.616
"Wishing Mr. Di..."

230
07:49.608 --> 07:50.655
(May Mrs. Di stay young and pretty.)

231
07:50.655 --> 07:51.655
"May Mrs. Di..."

232
07:53.855 --> 07:54.376
Honey,

233
07:54.655 --> 07:56.056
they don't suit my skin type.

234
07:56.855 --> 07:58.136
Who here has oily skin?

235
07:58.535 --> 07:59.176
Take them.

236
07:59.256 --> 07:59.576
I do.

237
07:59.576 --> 08:00.736
Thank you, Mrs. Di.

238
08:01.256 --> 08:01.975
Thank you.

239
08:02.095 --> 08:03.136
This brand

240
08:03.576 --> 08:04.736
is super expensive.

241
08:04.975 --> 08:06.616
It's super pricey.

242
08:09.000 --> 08:11.080
(May Mrs. Di stay young and pretty.)

243
08:13.655 --> 08:14.376
Right, honey.

244
08:14.936 --> 08:15.975
I have a dinner meeting.

245
08:16.736 --> 08:18.455
I have a small request.

246
08:18.736 --> 08:20.016
Can I drink a little tonight?

247
08:20.215 --> 08:21.136
Just a tiny bit.

248
08:21.256 --> 08:22.016
With whom?

249
08:22.295 --> 08:22.975
Other bosses.

250
08:23.176 --> 08:24.016
It's for business.

251
08:24.295 --> 08:25.095
I'll have to drink.

252
08:27.256 --> 08:27.655
Mr. Di.

253
08:28.736 --> 08:29.775
Finance needs you

254
08:29.775 --> 08:30.455
to review a report.

255
08:31.936 --> 08:32.456
Be right back.

256
08:32.976 --> 08:33.415
Okay.

257
08:44.072 --> 08:46.290
(Chairman Di Liren)

258
08:53.216 --> 08:53.895
Feeling

259
08:53.895 --> 08:54.935
Mr. Di's charisma?

260
08:59.655 --> 09:00.175
So you all

261
09:00.216 --> 09:01.096
look up to him.

262
09:01.736 --> 09:02.415
They do.

263
09:03.575 --> 09:05.815
Self-made, caring to staff,

264
09:06.055 --> 09:08.096
handsome, witty, and loves his wife.

265
09:08.456 --> 09:09.415
Who wouldn't admire

266
09:09.976 --> 09:10.736
a man like that?

267
09:11.136 --> 09:12.175
Jiali is a 30-year-old brand

268
09:12.175 --> 09:13.575
my dad built from scratch.

269
09:13.895 --> 09:15.376
How is he "self-made"?

270
09:16.336 --> 09:17.535
Still, you have to admit,

271
09:18.175 --> 09:19.136
Jiali became a top

272
09:19.256 --> 09:20.415
domestic cosmetics brand

273
09:20.655 --> 09:22.055
after he took over

274
09:22.055 --> 09:22.935
and restructured it.

275
09:23.935 --> 09:24.775
Before that,

276
09:24.976 --> 09:26.216
it was just a local name.

277
09:27.616 --> 09:29.055
Actually, I've always wondered.

278
09:30.616 --> 09:33.055
If the wife of a male boss is called the boss's wife,

279
09:33.695 --> 09:35.256
what do we call the husband

280
09:35.616 --> 09:36.256
of a female boss?

281
09:38.216 --> 09:39.895
If you're the boss of Jiali,

282
09:41.256 --> 09:42.496
what should we call Mr. Di?

283
09:43.456 --> 09:44.856
Back in college,

284
09:45.016 --> 09:46.256
I wondered about that too.

285
09:46.856 --> 09:48.976
Other classes had male advisors,

286
09:49.815 --> 09:50.575
so his wife was

287
09:50.616 --> 09:51.616
the "advisor's wife".

288
09:52.415 --> 09:53.935
But our advisor was female.

289
09:54.256 --> 09:55.055
So we

290
09:55.295 --> 09:55.695
didn't know

291
09:55.695 --> 09:56.815
what to call her husband.

292
09:57.695 --> 09:58.295
What did you do?

293
09:59.096 --> 10:00.655
We just called him Mr. Gu.

294
10:01.136 --> 10:02.096
His last name was Gu.

295
10:02.815 --> 10:04.016
Was he a teacher as well?

296
10:04.736 --> 10:05.456
Not really.

297
10:06.295 --> 10:07.175
That was the best way

298
10:07.655 --> 10:08.695
to address him.

299
10:09.136 --> 10:10.136
If you ask me,

300
10:10.736 --> 10:11.856
I think the title "boss"

301
10:12.175 --> 10:12.976
sounds better

302
10:13.575 --> 10:14.655
than "the boss's wife".

303
10:22.856 --> 10:23.815
Are you really going?

304
10:24.496 --> 10:25.216
Don't you hate

305
10:25.256 --> 10:26.096
dinner meetings?

306
10:27.496 --> 10:28.655
I asked Zhang Tao.

307
10:28.976 --> 10:30.136
He said tonight's dinner

308
10:30.256 --> 10:31.175
is quite important.

309
10:32.055 --> 10:33.175
Mr. Wu controls most of

310
10:33.175 --> 10:34.175
the distribution channels

311
10:34.216 --> 10:35.175
nationwide.

312
10:35.535 --> 10:36.376
When he hosts,

313
10:36.616 --> 10:37.976
almost nobody turns him down.

314
10:38.415 --> 10:38.775
Ready.

315
10:44.295 --> 10:44.736
Looks good.

316
10:51.456 --> 10:52.136
- Got it? - Good.

317
10:52.655 --> 10:53.175
Take a look.

318
10:53.415 --> 10:54.016
Let me see.

319
10:56.055 --> 10:57.575
When you said you were going,

320
10:57.695 --> 10:58.775
wasn't Di Liren surprised?

321
10:59.456 --> 11:00.016
No.

322
11:01.535 --> 11:02.415
I just told him

323
11:02.856 --> 11:04.016
I have to wear this new dress

324
11:04.376 --> 11:05.336
before it goes out of style.

325
11:05.695 --> 11:06.575
And he bought it.

326
11:08.216 --> 11:09.695
Everyone in Jiali is under his spell

327
11:10.016 --> 11:11.415
after all these years.

328
11:12.216 --> 11:13.376
I just want to see

329
11:13.535 --> 11:14.415
how things are

330
11:14.535 --> 11:15.055
out there

331
11:15.136 --> 11:15.856
in the real world.

332
11:17.856 --> 11:18.456
These photos

333
11:18.655 --> 11:19.175
look fine.

334
11:19.456 --> 11:19.815
Alright.

335
11:20.016 --> 11:21.055
That's the OOTD.

336
11:21.055 --> 11:21.456
Done.

337
11:23.336 --> 11:24.736
You'll be the only wife

338
11:24.856 --> 11:25.695
among those guys.

339
11:25.815 --> 11:26.456
Will it work?

340
11:26.856 --> 11:27.935
I'm not just a "wife".

341
11:28.496 --> 11:29.376
Jiali belongs to my dad.

342
11:31.295 --> 11:31.935
Besides,

343
11:32.695 --> 11:34.496
when he took over Jiali,

344
11:34.616 --> 11:35.616
I went with him

345
11:35.616 --> 11:36.815
to build his connections

346
11:36.815 --> 11:37.575
at those dinners.

347
11:37.935 --> 11:39.055
That's how he got here.

348
11:40.376 --> 11:41.175
I still think

349
11:41.295 --> 11:42.616
you should skip

350
11:42.856 --> 11:43.736
such dinners.

351
11:44.175 --> 11:44.616
Why do you

352
11:44.655 --> 11:45.575
sound just like him?

353
11:45.976 --> 11:46.895
He kept saying,

354
11:47.216 --> 11:47.935
"Meng,

355
11:48.016 --> 11:49.216
maybe you shouldn't come.

356
11:49.415 --> 11:50.175
Tonight's dinner

357
11:50.175 --> 11:51.256
isn't for you."

358
11:51.616 --> 11:52.096
Bah.

359
11:52.895 --> 11:53.935
What nonsense.

360
11:56.055 --> 11:57.136
Think about it, Zi.

361
11:57.976 --> 11:58.976
What could be

362
11:59.535 --> 12:00.496
more disgusting

363
12:00.535 --> 12:01.655
than someone stealing

364
12:02.016 --> 12:03.216
another family's fortune?

365
12:24.496 --> 12:25.575
- Great. - Great.

366
12:25.895 --> 12:26.736
- Beautiful. - Great.

367
12:32.336 --> 12:33.575
Mr. Wu loves this stuff.

368
12:33.815 --> 12:34.655
That's why I said

369
12:34.815 --> 12:35.775
it wasn't for you.

370
12:36.976 --> 12:37.815
It's fine.

371
12:38.256 --> 12:39.096
Why wouldn't it be?

372
12:41.175 --> 12:42.175
Belly dancing

373
12:42.535 --> 12:43.856
has open tournaments

374
12:43.856 --> 12:44.616
even in China.

375
12:45.055 --> 12:45.815
Abroad,

376
12:46.055 --> 12:47.456
there are competitions

377
12:47.535 --> 12:48.415
on par with the Olympics.

378
12:49.695 --> 12:50.256
Honey,

379
12:50.775 --> 12:51.815
you sure know a lot.

380
12:52.535 --> 12:53.575
Not really.

381
12:54.136 --> 12:55.216
Mr. Wu told me all that.

382
12:57.736 --> 12:58.535
Belly dancing

383
12:58.815 --> 13:00.535
is fitness,

384
13:00.856 --> 13:02.295
an art of power and aesthetics.

385
13:02.976 --> 13:04.016
Only dirty minds

386
13:04.136 --> 13:05.256
think the dance is dirty.

387
13:06.695 --> 13:07.775
I told Han Guang

388
13:08.096 --> 13:08.935
to do the talking.

389
13:09.175 --> 13:09.856
If it's too much,

390
13:09.976 --> 13:10.935
I can send you home.

391
13:12.055 --> 13:12.695
No need.

392
13:13.496 --> 13:14.575
The dance is pretty.

393
13:14.856 --> 13:16.016
I don't want to leave yet.

394
13:17.655 --> 13:18.616
That's enough.

395
13:28.496 --> 13:29.055
Mr. Wu,

396
13:29.376 --> 13:30.935
thank you for looking out for Liren.

397
13:31.136 --> 13:32.136
Here, let me toast you.

398
13:36.295 --> 13:37.136
And this is...?

399
13:41.055 --> 13:41.616
Come on.

400
13:42.496 --> 13:44.016
A toast to the young lady.

401
13:44.815 --> 13:45.815
Sure, I'll join.

402
13:46.295 --> 13:46.935
Come on.

403
13:47.376 --> 13:48.935
Hi, I'm Weng Yue.

404
13:51.496 --> 13:52.175
Nice to meet you.

405
13:52.616 --> 13:53.055
Hello.

406
13:54.895 --> 13:56.535
Why didn't you say hi to me?

407
14:00.136 --> 14:00.655
Hello.

408
14:03.136 --> 14:03.856
Meng

409
14:04.136 --> 14:05.695
is also a creator.

410
14:05.856 --> 14:07.336
You're in the same field.

411
14:09.815 --> 14:10.336
Really?

412
14:10.415 --> 14:12.216
What a coincidence, Meng.

413
14:13.016 --> 14:13.976
You should follow me.

414
14:18.256 --> 14:18.976
Phone, right?

415
14:19.935 --> 14:20.535
I got it.

416
14:22.736 --> 14:24.655
I can dance and hand over phones.

417
14:25.415 --> 14:26.055
Here.

418
14:26.575 --> 14:27.336
Follow her.

419
14:27.575 --> 14:27.935
Go ahead.

420
14:28.055 --> 14:28.616
Thanks, Mr. Han.

421
14:30.256 --> 14:30.895
Allow me.

422
14:44.256 --> 14:44.736
Okay.

423
14:45.136 --> 14:45.695
Done.

424
14:47.016 --> 14:47.376
Okay.

425
14:47.376 --> 14:48.415
Let's drink.

426
14:48.775 --> 14:49.535
Cheers.

427
14:49.535 --> 14:50.175
Cheers.

428
14:50.295 --> 14:51.456
Cheers.

429
14:51.575 --> 14:52.695
- Cheers. - Bottoms up.

430
14:57.136 --> 14:57.815
Thank you, Mr. Wu.

431
14:58.655 --> 14:59.775
Thanks for following me.

432
15:00.815 --> 15:01.655
But my agency

433
15:01.655 --> 15:03.376
manages my account,

434
15:03.775 --> 15:05.096
so I can't follow back.

435
15:06.175 --> 15:07.256
You don't mind, do you?

436
15:08.376 --> 15:09.376
Of course not.

437
15:09.736 --> 15:10.175
I'm not

438
15:10.256 --> 15:11.136
desperate for one follower.

439
15:16.616 --> 15:17.415
Right.

440
15:18.096 --> 15:19.456
That video you posted

441
15:19.616 --> 15:20.216
went viral.

442
15:20.336 --> 15:21.535
It got you tons of followers, huh?

443
15:24.895 --> 15:26.496
Are you done being mad at your husband?

444
15:30.376 --> 15:31.136
She's still

445
15:31.175 --> 15:32.096
pretty mad at me.

446
15:32.376 --> 15:33.136
It's my fault.

447
15:33.575 --> 15:34.815
I've been so busy lately

448
15:35.136 --> 15:36.175
that my wife

449
15:36.295 --> 15:37.295
felt neglected.

450
15:38.136 --> 15:38.935
Yeah.

451
15:39.055 --> 15:39.815
Mr. Di and I

452
15:39.935 --> 15:40.655
have been swamped

453
15:40.775 --> 15:42.376
with Jiali's new product launch.

454
15:43.456 --> 15:44.376
Speaking of which,

455
15:45.096 --> 15:46.616
Mr. Wu, about our contract...

456
15:47.496 --> 15:48.895
Don't rush me.

457
15:49.295 --> 15:50.575
Has Mr. Weng agreed yet?

458
15:51.655 --> 15:52.575
My father-in-law said

459
15:53.136 --> 15:54.575
he trusts me completely

460
15:55.055 --> 15:55.695
with the company.

461
15:58.136 --> 15:58.655
Weng Yue,

462
15:59.695 --> 16:01.016
how is your sister?

463
16:02.575 --> 16:03.336
Same as usual.

464
16:04.055 --> 16:05.655
Take good care of Yue.

465
16:06.256 --> 16:07.456
Her sister is sick.

466
16:08.055 --> 16:08.935
Running deals

467
16:09.055 --> 16:10.055
with her brother-in-law

468
16:10.216 --> 16:11.775
day in and day out

469
16:11.935 --> 16:12.616
can't be easy.

470
16:13.695 --> 16:14.695
It really isn't.

471
16:15.935 --> 16:17.815
She's been a huge help at the company.

472
16:18.415 --> 16:19.856
I owe her a lot.

473
16:20.575 --> 16:21.575
Join us for a drink.

474
16:21.575 --> 16:22.216
Cheers.

475
16:22.856 --> 16:23.575
Come on.

476
16:23.575 --> 16:23.976
Cheers.

477
16:23.976 --> 16:24.415
Together.

478
16:25.856 --> 16:26.456
Cheers.

479
16:29.376 --> 16:30.096
Excuse me.

480
16:38.976 --> 16:39.496
Are you upset?

481
16:42.775 --> 16:44.175
Mr. Wu is disgusting.

482
16:44.376 --> 16:45.815
This whole dinner is also sickening.

483
16:46.016 --> 16:47.295
Joking about Weng Yue

484
16:47.815 --> 16:48.935
and flattering that trophy wife.

485
16:49.055 --> 16:49.856
What for?

486
16:49.976 --> 16:51.055
She's just a homewrecker.

487
16:51.655 --> 16:52.736
What a joke.

488
16:53.575 --> 16:54.856
Did Mr. Wu forget

489
16:55.136 --> 16:56.376
he built his fortune

490
16:56.456 --> 16:57.456
thanks to his wife's family?

491
16:57.616 --> 16:58.496
If his wife's family

492
16:58.616 --> 16:59.376
weren't so rich,

493
16:59.655 --> 17:00.935
could he have built a big firm?

494
17:02.216 --> 17:03.575
That's why I love coming home.

495
17:05.095 --> 17:06.095
It's filthy out there.

496
17:06.456 --> 17:07.095
That's why

497
17:07.176 --> 17:08.575
I shower as soon as I get home.

498
17:09.375 --> 17:10.535
Playing the victim now?

499
17:11.736 --> 17:12.696
I'm warning you.

500
17:13.256 --> 17:14.416
Never do what they did.

501
17:14.656 --> 17:15.656
Or I'll kick you out.

502
17:16.456 --> 17:18.216
I've consulted a lawyer.

503
17:19.095 --> 17:20.575
I can make you leave with nothing.

504
17:21.575 --> 17:22.295
What lawyer?

505
17:23.375 --> 17:24.855
A top-tier one,

506
17:25.256 --> 17:26.176
anyway.

507
17:26.736 --> 17:27.416
Sure.

508
17:28.416 --> 17:29.416
I wouldn't stand a chance

509
17:29.855 --> 17:30.775
against such a lawyer.

510
17:31.135 --> 17:32.095
I wouldn't dare.

511
17:32.976 --> 17:34.095
I was selfish tonight.

512
17:34.736 --> 17:36.135
Sorry it upset you so much.

513
17:36.815 --> 17:37.335
How about

514
17:37.815 --> 17:39.176
I have the driver take you home?

515
17:40.815 --> 17:42.416
Forget it. I'm already here.

516
17:42.775 --> 17:44.135
Let me see how it goes.

517
17:44.696 --> 17:45.135
Let's go.

518
18:15.696 --> 18:16.496
Why are you here?

519
18:17.936 --> 18:18.535
Being there

520
18:18.575 --> 18:19.615
when a client needs you

521
18:19.736 --> 18:20.575
is basic etiquette

522
18:20.696 --> 18:21.575
for any lawyer.

523
18:24.416 --> 18:25.055
What a coincidence.

524
18:27.176 --> 18:28.055
Well,

525
18:28.535 --> 18:29.256
walk with me?

526
18:33.976 --> 18:34.375
Never mind.

527
18:34.775 --> 18:35.736
If you're busy,

528
18:35.855 --> 18:36.496
go ahead.

529
18:36.855 --> 18:37.815
Let me take this call.

530
18:42.176 --> 18:42.615
Hello?

531
18:43.375 --> 18:43.976
Another time.

532
18:47.848 --> 18:49.936
(Mute)

533
18:49.936 --> 18:51.375
Your perfume smells

534
18:52.176 --> 18:52.976
like red wine.

535
18:53.535 --> 18:54.135
I went

536
18:54.135 --> 18:55.375
to a dinner meeting with Di Liren.

537
18:56.135 --> 18:56.896
I didn't want to

538
18:57.016 --> 18:57.656
join the afterparty

539
18:57.896 --> 18:59.815
and came out for a walk.

540
19:02.375 --> 19:03.295
Saw the dirty side

541
19:03.295 --> 19:04.055
of businessmen?

542
19:04.775 --> 19:06.815
I saw the real world

543
19:07.055 --> 19:08.335
and the real him.

544
19:09.575 --> 19:10.896
I'm really curious.

545
19:11.216 --> 19:11.855
How did Di Liren

546
19:11.855 --> 19:13.176
win you over back then?

547
19:13.656 --> 19:14.615
With pure acting?

548
19:18.095 --> 19:19.615
Half was his acting,

549
19:20.375 --> 19:21.416
and half my imagination.

550
19:23.375 --> 19:24.696
I used to think

551
19:25.416 --> 19:26.656
he was my destined one.

552
19:28.135 --> 19:29.449
A car crash, an injury,

553
19:29.575 --> 19:30.456
and Prince Charming

554
19:30.736 --> 19:31.575
saved the princess.

555
19:32.656 --> 19:33.896
Or maybe my parents

556
19:34.736 --> 19:36.055
sheltered me too well.

557
19:37.095 --> 19:38.496
All the new, thrilling things

558
19:38.736 --> 19:40.416
he showed me

559
19:40.736 --> 19:41.736
never failed to move me.

560
19:43.055 --> 19:44.256
Besides, he told me

561
19:44.855 --> 19:46.016
about his tragic background.

562
19:46.335 --> 19:47.016
So

563
19:47.936 --> 19:49.016
my savior complex kicked in.

564
19:51.896 --> 19:52.656
Pitying a man

565
19:52.775 --> 19:54.295
who wants your pity

566
19:54.535 --> 19:56.416
is the start of a woman's downfall.

567
19:57.335 --> 19:58.095
He used to

568
19:58.216 --> 19:59.496
put me first no matter what.

569
20:00.256 --> 20:01.375
Even when he was sick,

570
20:01.896 --> 20:03.176
he put my feelings first.

571
20:05.016 --> 20:06.375
My parents were busy

572
20:07.615 --> 20:08.696
with the company

573
20:09.095 --> 20:10.095
when I was little.

574
20:11.135 --> 20:12.176
They hired nannies,

575
20:12.896 --> 20:13.496
drivers,

576
20:14.176 --> 20:14.896
and tutors.

577
20:15.855 --> 20:16.416
In short,

578
20:16.575 --> 20:17.696
I was surrounded by people

579
20:17.855 --> 20:18.656
every single day,

580
20:19.416 --> 20:20.815
but not a single one

581
20:21.416 --> 20:22.095
knew

582
20:22.135 --> 20:22.936
what I wanted.

583
20:23.855 --> 20:25.135
Did you have close friends?

584
20:26.095 --> 20:26.656
Yeah.

585
20:27.416 --> 20:28.055
Liu Zi.

586
20:28.936 --> 20:29.976
But she was pregnant

587
20:30.256 --> 20:31.976
and switching jobs.

588
20:32.295 --> 20:33.095
Super busy.

589
20:33.456 --> 20:34.615
Besides,

590
20:34.775 --> 20:35.535
I never liked

591
20:35.535 --> 20:36.656
making new friends.

592
20:37.095 --> 20:37.896
Makes sense.

593
20:38.335 --> 20:39.295
You were starved for love,

594
20:39.575 --> 20:41.016
and he slipped right in.

595
20:42.216 --> 20:42.855
Me?

596
20:43.696 --> 20:44.295
Starved for love?

597
20:45.896 --> 20:47.456
There's no shame in admitting it.

598
20:47.736 --> 20:49.575
Emotional support is valuable

599
20:49.656 --> 20:50.615
because it's rare.

600
20:51.335 --> 20:51.815
Di Liren

601
20:51.896 --> 20:53.176
knows what he's doing.

602
20:53.815 --> 20:54.496
It hurts, huh?

603
20:56.575 --> 20:57.375
I'm a bit tired.

604
20:59.535 --> 21:00.016
Let's sit.

605
21:01.176 --> 21:01.615
Okay.

606
21:08.976 --> 21:09.736
It's so dirty.

607
21:10.295 --> 21:11.095
Do you have tissues?

608
21:12.295 --> 21:13.295
Do I look like the type

609
21:13.456 --> 21:14.496
who carries wet wipes,

610
21:14.496 --> 21:15.696
dental floss, and hand cream?

611
21:17.135 --> 21:17.976
What do I do?

612
21:18.176 --> 21:19.256
It's way too dirty.

613
21:30.456 --> 21:31.016
Have a seat.

614
21:31.696 --> 21:32.256
Thanks.

615
21:48.535 --> 21:49.456
Are you wiping your hand

616
21:49.496 --> 21:50.055
on my suit?

617
21:56.095 --> 21:58.055
I'm using the side that touches the bench.

618
21:59.216 --> 22:00.656
A picky woman has a hard time dating

619
22:01.216 --> 22:02.216
after the divorce.

620
22:04.855 --> 22:05.736
Rest assured.

621
22:06.615 --> 22:07.295
I'll definitely

622
22:07.335 --> 22:07.855
find a man

623
22:07.896 --> 22:09.335
who carries tissues,

624
22:09.335 --> 22:09.896
wet wipes,

625
22:09.976 --> 22:11.216
floss, and hand cream for me.

626
22:20.696 --> 22:21.815
I only realized today

627
22:22.896 --> 22:24.496
that the world I shared with Di Liren

628
22:25.256 --> 22:26.095
was fake.

629
22:28.295 --> 22:28.815
Congratulations.

630
22:30.615 --> 22:32.095
To step out of The Truman Show,

631
22:32.416 --> 22:33.456
you first have to realize

632
22:34.216 --> 22:35.055
you are Truman.

633
22:37.016 --> 22:38.496
Now that I'm out, what next?

634
22:39.535 --> 22:40.656
His grip on the company

635
22:40.896 --> 22:42.416
runs far deeper than I imagined.

636
22:43.055 --> 22:43.696
About contracts

637
22:43.696 --> 22:44.656
he mentioned,

638
22:44.656 --> 22:45.960
do you know what they are for?

639
22:46.295 --> 22:47.815
And why was he taking money

640
22:47.976 --> 22:48.696
from home?

641
22:50.335 --> 22:50.855
No idea.

642
22:51.896 --> 22:52.615
He just said

643
22:52.736 --> 22:54.055
the company needed money.

644
22:54.295 --> 22:55.375
He never told me

645
22:55.575 --> 22:56.456
where the money went.

646
22:56.615 --> 22:57.575
If I ask again now,

647
22:57.936 --> 22:58.936
there's no way he'll talk.

648
22:59.456 --> 23:00.615
I have reason to suspect

649
23:01.176 --> 23:02.295
he is transferring assets

650
23:02.416 --> 23:03.216
through the company.

651
23:04.976 --> 23:05.815
What do we do?

652
23:06.896 --> 23:08.135
Have you checked Jiali's books?

653
23:15.936 --> 23:16.535
Meng.

654
23:17.936 --> 23:19.055
Crank up the bed.

655
23:19.535 --> 23:19.936
Okay.

656
23:22.416 --> 23:23.335
Won't you rest more?

657
23:24.095 --> 23:25.696
Those work files

658
23:26.335 --> 23:27.896
have been piling up.

659
23:28.256 --> 23:30.375
Liren has urged me several times.

660
23:30.736 --> 23:32.256
I need to sign them today.

661
23:32.615 --> 23:33.976
Roll the table over.

662
23:55.656 --> 23:57.192
(Yu Jianguo)

663
23:58.815 --> 23:59.216
Dad,

664
24:00.775 --> 24:02.256
I want you to sign something too.

665
24:02.976 --> 24:03.736
I want to

666
24:04.095 --> 24:05.135
check Jiali's books

667
24:05.416 --> 24:06.216
to see how it runs.

668
24:06.496 --> 24:07.216
Nonsense.

669
24:09.095 --> 24:10.575
You want to take my signature

670
24:10.575 --> 24:11.896
to audit the company?

671
24:12.736 --> 24:13.976
What will people think?

672
24:14.375 --> 24:15.456
How would I explain it?

673
24:16.615 --> 24:18.135
I have a good reason.

674
24:20.456 --> 24:21.176
No way.

675
24:24.896 --> 24:25.335
Dad,

676
24:27.216 --> 24:28.496
I need to tell you something.

677
24:29.575 --> 24:29.976
Go ahead.

678
24:31.615 --> 24:32.416
Did you know that

679
24:32.936 --> 24:33.416
Di Liren...

680
24:34.775 --> 24:35.815
What is that sound?

681
24:35.976 --> 24:36.976
It's awful.

682
24:37.335 --> 24:38.575
Turn it off.

683
24:38.656 --> 24:39.256
Wait, Dad.

684
24:39.295 --> 24:39.976
Let me look.

685
24:41.855 --> 24:42.615
Where is it?

686
24:45.375 --> 24:45.775
Hurry.

687
24:47.815 --> 24:48.416
Take it easy.

688
24:48.976 --> 24:49.896
Calm down.

689
24:50.936 --> 24:51.295
Here.

690
24:51.736 --> 24:52.335
Found it.

691
24:56.656 --> 24:57.016
Hello?

692
24:57.375 --> 24:57.976
Meng,

693
24:58.176 --> 24:59.335
I don't know

694
24:59.456 --> 25:00.416
where I left my phone.

695
25:00.456 --> 25:01.095
It's with my dad.

696
25:01.295 --> 25:02.055
How did you know?

697
25:02.815 --> 25:04.815
Didn't I call my own phone?

698
25:04.815 --> 25:05.135
Enough.

699
25:05.135 --> 25:06.256
I'll bring it back tonight.

700
25:06.256 --> 25:06.615
Bye.

701
25:06.615 --> 25:07.335
I'll go get it.

702
25:08.896 --> 25:09.535
How are you feeling?

703
25:09.575 --> 25:10.256
Much better.

704
25:13.256 --> 25:13.855
Meng.

705
25:14.976 --> 25:15.535
I can't.

706
25:16.456 --> 25:18.456
I can't sign the files today.

707
25:19.055 --> 25:20.216
I feel too sick.

708
25:22.535 --> 25:22.976
Okay.

709
25:23.696 --> 25:24.736
Then let it be.

710
25:25.375 --> 25:26.375
Just get some rest.

711
25:37.736 --> 25:38.575
Meng.

712
25:41.016 --> 25:41.696
What were you

713
25:41.696 --> 25:43.135
trying to say earlier?

714
25:45.256 --> 25:46.216
I wanted to say...

715
25:48.575 --> 25:49.456
I wanted to say

716
25:49.736 --> 25:51.656
that I signed up for a course

717
25:51.775 --> 25:52.736
on family business succession.

718
25:53.135 --> 25:53.775
Oh, you.

719
25:53.896 --> 25:55.855
All these years,

720
25:55.855 --> 25:58.216
how many classes have I paid for?

721
25:58.696 --> 26:00.775
Why didn't you take them seriously?

722
26:01.256 --> 26:02.615
I regret it now.

723
26:03.135 --> 26:04.216
From now on,

724
26:04.335 --> 26:05.936
I'll study hard every day.

725
26:07.496 --> 26:08.016
Enough.

726
26:08.575 --> 26:09.216
Stop talking.

727
26:09.456 --> 26:10.016
Just rest.

728
26:10.976 --> 26:12.815
Okay, I will.

729
26:18.095 --> 26:18.456
Hello.

730
26:19.095 --> 26:19.456
Hello.

731
26:19.575 --> 26:20.135
Mr. Huang?

732
26:20.256 --> 26:20.656
Yeah.

733
26:21.335 --> 26:21.936
We spoke

734
26:21.976 --> 26:22.656
online.

735
26:23.256 --> 26:24.335
I'm Mr. Jiao.

736
26:26.216 --> 26:27.176
(Middle-age Huang) Lawyer for

737
26:27.216 --> 26:28.055
our major client, Mi.

738
26:28.295 --> 26:29.095
She briefed me.

739
26:29.295 --> 26:30.256
How can I help you?

740
26:31.176 --> 26:31.855
You used to work

741
26:32.216 --> 26:33.055
for this company

742
26:33.095 --> 26:33.936
back in Xiaocheng,

743
26:33.976 --> 26:34.256
right?

744
26:34.535 --> 26:35.335
Yeah, that's right.

745
26:36.055 --> 26:37.055
So you and Di Liren

746
26:37.256 --> 26:38.016
were colleagues.

747
26:38.815 --> 26:39.176
Who?

748
26:42.615 --> 26:43.335
Him?

749
26:43.736 --> 26:44.535
We were colleagues,

750
26:45.016 --> 26:45.615
but

751
26:45.815 --> 26:47.295
what did you say his name was?

752
26:48.456 --> 26:49.055
Di Liren.

753
26:49.976 --> 26:50.936
That wasn't his name.

754
26:56.696 --> 26:58.135
What's going on?

755
26:59.496 --> 27:00.016
Look at you!

756
27:02.216 --> 27:02.936
Unbelievable.

757
27:02.936 --> 27:03.456
It's okay.

758
27:03.575 --> 27:04.615
It's all right.

759
27:07.896 --> 27:08.335
It's fine.

760
27:08.416 --> 27:08.855
It's okay.

761
27:08.855 --> 27:09.896
What are you doing?

762
27:10.256 --> 27:11.656
Where are your hands going?

763
27:11.775 --> 27:12.335
Get out.

764
27:12.335 --> 27:13.256
The doctor said

765
27:13.295 --> 27:13.896
the patient's airway

766
27:13.976 --> 27:15.135
must stay clear.

767
27:16.696 --> 27:17.696
Keep it down.

768
27:17.855 --> 27:18.416
The patient

769
27:18.416 --> 27:19.456
needs to rest.

770
27:19.896 --> 27:20.775
Why are you

771
27:20.775 --> 27:21.535
all siding

772
27:21.575 --> 27:22.375
with her?

773
27:22.815 --> 27:23.375
That's enough.

774
27:24.375 --> 27:24.896
Come here.

775
27:25.176 --> 27:25.496
Stop it.

776
27:25.496 --> 27:26.496
Leave us alone.

777
27:26.815 --> 27:27.815
Stop fighting.

778
27:28.095 --> 27:28.736
Get out.

779
27:30.815 --> 27:31.135
Leave.

780
27:31.256 --> 27:32.416
Right now.

781
27:34.615 --> 27:35.496
What's going on here?

782
27:35.575 --> 27:36.095
Meng.

783
27:36.896 --> 27:37.656
Make her leave.

784
27:38.055 --> 27:39.055
They're bullying me.

785
27:39.656 --> 27:40.496
Dad, are you okay?

786
27:42.656 --> 27:43.496
Calm down.

787
27:57.535 --> 27:58.416
Are you okay, Ms. Hui?

788
27:59.135 --> 27:59.535
I'm fine.

789
28:02.696 --> 28:03.375
I'm so sorry

790
28:04.135 --> 28:05.016
about that.

791
28:05.295 --> 28:06.295
My mom loses it

792
28:06.615 --> 28:07.575
whenever she's stressed.

793
28:07.815 --> 28:09.095
I already sent her home.

794
28:09.295 --> 28:09.976
I understand.

795
28:10.575 --> 28:11.535
She's stressed.

796
28:12.416 --> 28:13.535
(Use your connections)

797
28:13.696 --> 28:14.295
(to find out)

798
28:14.335 --> 28:15.335
(about Lu Hui's past.)

799
28:16.456 --> 28:17.295
Well, Ms. Hui,

800
28:18.456 --> 28:19.496
I'm planning

801
28:19.615 --> 28:20.656
to write to your agency

802
28:20.936 --> 28:21.656
about how well

803
28:21.775 --> 28:22.615
you've been doing.

804
28:23.016 --> 28:23.736
I even filmed

805
28:23.736 --> 28:24.375
a short video.

806
28:24.896 --> 28:25.416
No need.

807
28:25.696 --> 28:26.815
It's just my job.

808
28:27.135 --> 28:28.095
That won't do.

809
28:28.855 --> 28:30.016
You do such a great job.

810
28:30.216 --> 28:31.375
Everyone should see it.

811
28:31.656 --> 28:32.615
You deserve the praise.

812
28:34.016 --> 28:34.535
Ms. Hui,

813
28:34.896 --> 28:36.295
could I edit this clip

814
28:36.535 --> 28:37.496
into a vlog?

815
28:37.855 --> 28:38.456
A vlog?

816
28:39.656 --> 28:41.335
You know, those life vlogs

817
28:41.335 --> 28:42.575
I usually post

818
28:42.615 --> 28:43.055
online.

819
28:43.775 --> 28:45.176
I want my followers to see

820
28:45.295 --> 28:46.416
what my life looks like,

821
28:46.535 --> 28:47.416
and how nice you are

822
28:47.416 --> 28:47.936
to us.

823
28:48.575 --> 28:49.775
No, Meng, don't.

824
28:49.896 --> 28:51.016
I...

825
28:51.976 --> 28:53.135
I'm not photogenic at all.

826
28:53.535 --> 28:54.615
Don't worry.

827
28:55.095 --> 28:55.855
My phone makes everyone

828
28:55.936 --> 28:56.775
look amazing.

829
28:57.335 --> 28:58.416
And you have no idea.

830
28:58.615 --> 29:00.135
The more real and down-to-earth,

831
29:00.375 --> 29:02.375
the more viral

832
29:02.575 --> 29:03.295
it gets.

833
29:03.456 --> 29:04.375
No!

834
29:04.575 --> 29:05.016
Meng...

835
29:05.615 --> 29:05.976
Well...

836
29:06.936 --> 29:08.216
Please post something else.

837
29:08.575 --> 29:09.256
Don't post me.

838
29:09.696 --> 29:10.135
I...

839
29:10.736 --> 29:11.736
Not even from behind?

840
29:15.256 --> 29:16.575
Meng, I've got something

841
29:17.575 --> 29:18.855
to tell you.

842
29:19.375 --> 29:19.976
What is it?

843
29:20.936 --> 29:23.216
I've given it some thought.

844
29:23.815 --> 29:25.135
You should get someone else

845
29:25.615 --> 29:26.496
for your parents.

846
29:26.976 --> 29:28.016
With me around,

847
29:28.295 --> 29:29.575
your mom gets agitated.

848
29:30.095 --> 29:31.095
Her bad mood

849
29:31.095 --> 29:31.696
directly

850
29:31.775 --> 29:32.656
affects your dad.

851
29:33.135 --> 29:33.736
The doctor said

852
29:34.335 --> 29:35.736
that's not good for his recovery.

853
29:35.976 --> 29:36.696
What do you mean?

854
29:37.216 --> 29:38.256
Are you quitting, Ms. Hui?

855
29:39.256 --> 29:39.936
You can't.

856
29:40.256 --> 29:41.535
We haven't found anyone.

857
29:41.615 --> 29:42.335
You can't leave.

858
29:42.775 --> 29:43.936
Your mom has asked the head nurse

859
29:44.016 --> 29:44.815
to look for someone.

860
29:45.176 --> 29:46.135
Take your time.

861
29:46.416 --> 29:47.736
I can stay for a few more days.

862
29:47.736 --> 29:48.976
I'll hand over

863
29:48.976 --> 29:49.855
all the details

864
29:49.896 --> 29:50.496
about your dad

865
29:50.575 --> 29:51.496
to the next caregiver.

866
29:52.176 --> 29:52.855
This past year,

867
29:54.135 --> 29:55.375
I've treated your parents

868
29:55.456 --> 29:56.335
like my own family.

869
29:56.575 --> 29:57.575
So don't worry.

870
29:58.855 --> 29:59.656
I won't slack off

871
29:59.656 --> 30:00.535
at the end.

872
30:00.976 --> 30:02.095
Thank you

873
30:03.335 --> 30:04.535
for your hard work.

874
30:05.855 --> 30:06.456
Don't mention it.

875
30:06.896 --> 30:07.736
Still, I hope

876
30:07.775 --> 30:08.696
you'll reconsider

877
30:09.055 --> 30:09.976
staying on.

878
30:15.656 --> 30:16.456
We need to talk.

879
30:16.575 --> 30:17.375
Are you alone?

880
30:25.976 --> 30:26.375
Hello?

881
30:26.936 --> 30:27.335
Go ahead.

882
30:27.535 --> 30:28.256
You know Di Liren

883
30:28.295 --> 30:28.936
changed his name?

884
30:29.736 --> 30:30.216
Yeah, I do.

885
30:31.456 --> 30:32.416
He changed his surname.

886
30:32.936 --> 30:33.976
His dad ran off early on.

887
30:34.135 --> 30:35.016
His mom raised him

888
30:35.055 --> 30:35.936
all by herself.

889
30:37.295 --> 30:38.775
He knew how hard it was for her,

890
30:39.335 --> 30:40.696
so after she passed away,

891
30:41.375 --> 30:42.375
he took her maiden name.

892
30:43.855 --> 30:45.095
Do you know his former name?

893
30:46.456 --> 30:47.736
I saw it on the household register.

894
30:47.936 --> 30:49.456
I forgot the exact name,

895
30:49.615 --> 30:50.176
but it was

896
30:50.256 --> 30:51.295
something common.

897
30:52.736 --> 30:53.615
Fang Yong.

898
30:53.855 --> 30:54.496
"Yong" as in brave.

899
30:55.696 --> 30:56.496
Right, Fang Yong.

900
30:57.095 --> 30:57.416
What...

901
31:00.416 --> 31:01.295
What did you find?

902
31:02.256 --> 31:03.176
Lu Hui knew Di Liren

903
31:03.176 --> 31:03.936
before she went

904
31:04.176 --> 31:05.095
to work for you.

905
31:09.335 --> 31:10.216
I knew it.

906
31:11.496 --> 31:12.976
He sent her to us.

907
31:13.656 --> 31:14.575
There's more.

908
31:14.896 --> 31:16.256
Di Liren, formerly Fang Yong,

909
31:16.416 --> 31:18.095
used to be married to Lu Hui.

910
31:20.656 --> 31:21.335
I sent you the proof.

911
31:25.535 --> 31:25.976
Watch out.

912
31:26.736 --> 31:27.815
Yong, Hui.

913
31:28.135 --> 31:28.815
This table.

914
31:29.055 --> 31:29.736
(21 years ago, Xiaocheng) Here?

915
31:30.615 --> 31:31.615
Thanks for the treat, Yong.

916
31:31.696 --> 31:32.815
Whenever you're top sales,

917
31:33.016 --> 31:33.855
we get hot pot.

918
31:35.095 --> 31:36.335
Where's everyone else?

919
31:37.775 --> 31:38.656
Doing inventory.

920
31:38.855 --> 31:39.416
They'll come.

921
31:39.696 --> 31:40.615
(Young Huang) You're due soon, huh?

922
31:40.775 --> 31:41.496
How far along are you?

923
31:42.095 --> 31:43.095
Just hit six months.

924
31:44.135 --> 31:44.496
Yong.

925
31:44.936 --> 31:46.496
Are you going home for the Spring Festival?

926
31:46.976 --> 31:48.095
The nurses work

927
31:48.295 --> 31:49.135
until the third day.

928
31:49.575 --> 31:50.256
We won't bother.

929
31:51.335 --> 31:51.936
Besides,

930
31:52.176 --> 31:52.815
she's pregnant.

931
31:53.496 --> 31:53.936
I'll visit

932
31:54.135 --> 31:55.190
her parents' graves later.

933
31:55.416 --> 31:56.295
We'll stay at home.

934
31:57.416 --> 31:58.295
Will your parents come?

935
31:58.615 --> 31:59.575
They must be thrilled

936
31:59.775 --> 32:00.535
by the good news.

937
32:00.815 --> 32:01.696
They passed away

938
32:01.936 --> 32:02.535
quite early.

939
32:02.896 --> 32:04.016
I had no idea.

940
32:04.095 --> 32:04.855
I'm so sorry.

941
32:05.575 --> 32:06.896
It's okay. That's in the past.

942
32:08.016 --> 32:08.736
And now,

943
32:09.256 --> 32:10.416
we have our little home.

944
32:11.456 --> 32:13.216
It'll be a family of three soon.

945
32:14.976 --> 32:15.656
He changed his name

946
32:15.736 --> 32:16.936
to hide this marriage.

947
32:19.335 --> 32:19.855
Hello?

948
32:21.696 --> 32:22.976
Hello? Are you still there?

949
32:25.456 --> 32:26.976
So, he's been lying to me

950
32:27.575 --> 32:28.335
all along.

951
32:28.696 --> 32:29.375
He quit his job

952
32:29.375 --> 32:30.496
before the baby was born.

953
32:30.736 --> 32:32.176
After the due date passed,

954
32:32.176 --> 32:32.936
Huang called him,

955
32:33.375 --> 32:34.815
but he had changed his number

956
32:34.855 --> 32:35.416
and moved.

957
32:35.775 --> 32:37.055
They lost touch completely.

958
32:37.535 --> 32:38.535
Having a baby

959
32:38.575 --> 32:39.656
takes so much money.

960
32:40.095 --> 32:41.216
Why quit out of nowhere

961
32:41.855 --> 32:43.176
when his job was going so well?

962
32:43.976 --> 32:44.976
What about the baby?

963
32:45.375 --> 32:46.736
I'm afraid only the two of them

964
32:46.976 --> 32:47.496
know

965
32:47.535 --> 32:48.456
what happened next.

966
32:49.055 --> 32:50.135
Meng wanted to post my video,

967
32:50.216 --> 32:51.456
but I said no.

968
32:51.936 --> 32:52.535
You're right.

969
32:52.896 --> 32:54.216
She's been acting strange.

970
32:55.256 --> 32:56.416
I really should leave.

971
32:57.135 --> 32:58.216
I've asked to leave.

972
32:58.656 --> 32:59.055
Really?

973
32:59.775 --> 33:00.335
Great.

974
33:00.896 --> 33:01.615
Don't let her

975
33:01.696 --> 33:03.095
post anything about me.

976
33:03.496 --> 33:04.335
People may see it.

977
33:04.736 --> 33:05.295
I know.

978
33:05.575 --> 33:05.976
Rest assured.

979
33:06.535 --> 33:07.815
I have nothing to worry about

980
33:08.095 --> 33:09.176
once you get out of it.

981
33:12.736 --> 33:14.095
Mommy is so sorry.

982
33:15.696 --> 33:17.375
Mommy is so sorry.

983
33:18.976 --> 33:19.656
What happened?

984
33:20.416 --> 33:21.615
Out of money for treatment.

985
33:27.775 --> 33:29.656
(You said it would take 300,000 yuan?)

986
33:30.416 --> 33:31.535
(Five years ago, Xiaocheng) That's just for the surgery,

987
33:32.135 --> 33:33.855
and that's a conservative estimate.

988
33:34.696 --> 33:36.855
After that, he'll need rehabilitation

989
33:37.016 --> 33:38.295
and long-term medication.

990
33:38.736 --> 33:40.535
He has Tetralogy of Fallot

991
33:40.936 --> 33:42.295
with pulmonary atresia.

992
33:42.496 --> 33:43.095
It's a complex

993
33:43.256 --> 33:44.615
congenital heart condition.

994
33:45.176 --> 33:46.615
Is the surgery absolutely necessary?

995
33:47.936 --> 33:49.335
He collapsed only because

996
33:49.535 --> 33:50.416
he exerted himself

997
33:50.496 --> 33:51.936
when running in PE class.

998
33:53.416 --> 33:53.936
He's almost

999
33:54.055 --> 33:55.256
going to high school.

1000
33:56.416 --> 33:57.496
His height and weight

1001
33:57.775 --> 33:58.736
are all quite normal.

1002
33:59.656 --> 34:00.575
It shouldn't be

1003
34:00.575 --> 34:01.656
that serious, right?

1004
34:02.416 --> 34:03.256
Over the past decade,

1005
34:03.656 --> 34:04.295
he's undergone

1006
34:04.295 --> 34:05.456
multiple surgeries.

1007
34:06.176 --> 34:09.055
But artificial patches have a limited lifespan.

1008
34:09.416 --> 34:10.896
We must operate again,

1009
34:11.215 --> 34:12.735
otherwise all previous efforts

1010
34:13.496 --> 34:14.336
will go to waste.

1011
34:14.936 --> 34:15.416
Can I...

1012
34:16.416 --> 34:17.936
Can I pay part of it first?

1013
34:18.296 --> 34:19.376
That's hospital policy.

1014
34:27.894 --> 34:29.487
(Fang Yong)

1015
34:49.281 --> 34:52.328
(Fang Yong)

1016
34:56.072 --> 34:59.560
(Deadbeat, pay your debts)

1017
35:07.255 --> 35:08.296
You're back, Hui.

1018
35:09.416 --> 35:10.376
I borrowed money.

1019
35:11.816 --> 35:12.615
From whom?

1020
35:13.896 --> 35:15.336
Come on, sit down.

1021
35:15.735 --> 35:16.535
Let's have a feast.

1022
35:21.175 --> 35:22.336
How much does it cost?

1023
35:22.735 --> 35:23.896
It looks so expensive.

1024
35:24.336 --> 35:25.175
Someone treated me.

1025
35:25.735 --> 35:26.655
I brought back the leftovers.

1026
35:30.135 --> 35:31.095
We haven't

1027
35:31.175 --> 35:32.336
had such a feast in so long.

1028
35:34.135 --> 35:34.655
You've gotten

1029
35:35.575 --> 35:36.135
so thin.

1030
35:38.416 --> 35:39.255
Three hundred thousand.

1031
35:39.735 --> 35:40.535
Who did you

1032
35:41.016 --> 35:41.896
borrow it from?

1033
35:45.416 --> 35:46.135
A girl got into

1034
35:47.055 --> 35:47.735
a car accident.

1035
35:48.135 --> 35:49.175
I was passing by

1036
35:49.575 --> 35:50.255
and rushed her

1037
35:50.296 --> 35:51.095
to the hospital.

1038
35:51.615 --> 35:52.615
Her father wanted to thank me

1039
35:53.055 --> 35:53.816
with some money.

1040
35:54.936 --> 35:55.976
I turned it down.

1041
35:57.976 --> 35:59.336
But I thought about the surgery

1042
36:01.135 --> 36:04.135
and went back to him.

1043
36:06.016 --> 36:06.695
I told him

1044
36:07.615 --> 36:08.575
I'd pay him back

1045
36:09.135 --> 36:09.976
one day.

1046
36:10.615 --> 36:11.695
She must be very pretty.

1047
36:14.575 --> 36:15.695
Her family must be rich.

1048
36:17.016 --> 36:18.496
I think they're in business.

1049
36:18.896 --> 36:19.896
You'll pay it back.

1050
36:21.175 --> 36:22.055
With what?

1051
36:24.535 --> 36:25.695
Let's see how it goes.

1052
36:26.135 --> 36:26.856
Next month,

1053
36:27.655 --> 36:28.496
people are coming

1054
36:28.575 --> 36:29.735
to take this house away.

1055
36:30.055 --> 36:31.376
We won't even have a place to live.

1056
36:32.496 --> 36:33.416
How can you pay them back?

1057
36:34.336 --> 36:34.976
What can I do?

1058
36:37.735 --> 36:38.976
Give up on the surgery?

1059
36:41.615 --> 36:42.376
I've decided.

1060
36:43.655 --> 36:44.856
Worst case, let him sue me.

1061
36:45.655 --> 36:46.575
I have nothing to lose.

1062
36:47.575 --> 36:48.535
Lock me up if they want.

1063
36:49.336 --> 36:50.655
Our son will get the surgery.

1064
36:50.976 --> 36:51.735
What about me?

1065
36:52.816 --> 36:53.735
What about our son?

1066
36:54.856 --> 36:56.016
I didn't tell them

1067
36:56.655 --> 36:57.735
the money was for our kid.

1068
37:00.016 --> 37:01.055
I wouldn't drag you

1069
37:01.095 --> 37:01.735
into this.

1070
37:04.055 --> 37:06.416
You shouldn't have married me.

1071
37:09.735 --> 37:10.376
It's all my fault.

1072
37:12.776 --> 37:14.416
You shouldn't have to live like this.

1073
37:14.816 --> 37:16.215
Don't talk nonsense.

1074
37:17.135 --> 37:18.896
I've never once regretted marrying you.

1075
37:19.735 --> 37:20.336
Really?

1076
37:20.856 --> 37:21.575
Of course.

1077
37:24.776 --> 37:26.016
When you wiped her mouth,

1078
37:27.336 --> 37:28.655
were you thinking that too?

1079
37:44.520 --> 37:45.900
(Without me,)

1080
37:45.900 --> 37:49.488
(Mom and Dad would probably be happier.)

1081
37:50.695 --> 37:51.655
It's all my fault.

1082
37:54.175 --> 37:55.175
I'm useless.

1083
37:56.055 --> 37:56.976
That's why

1084
37:59.336 --> 38:00.175
he feels

1085
38:01.215 --> 38:02.215
he's a burden.

1086
38:03.055 --> 38:03.655
No, he doesn't.

1087
38:04.776 --> 38:06.095
I can put up with this,

1088
38:06.776 --> 38:07.615
but our boy can't.

1089
38:08.615 --> 38:09.255
He can't suffer

1090
38:09.336 --> 38:10.215
from our misery.

1091
38:11.296 --> 38:12.055
He needs to live

1092
38:13.135 --> 38:14.535
happily and free,

1093
38:15.376 --> 38:16.535
doing whatever he wants,

1094
38:17.615 --> 38:18.816
and never ever

1095
38:18.816 --> 38:19.735
hold back

1096
38:19.896 --> 38:20.735
by anything.

1097
38:22.055 --> 38:22.856
What do you mean?

1098
38:23.856 --> 38:24.456
I don't get it.

1099
38:26.735 --> 38:27.376
We have to

1100
38:27.376 --> 38:28.296
do whatever it takes.

1101
38:31.376 --> 38:32.215
Go tell her

1102
38:33.296 --> 38:34.016
that you're single,

1103
38:34.735 --> 38:35.615
that you have no kids,

1104
38:36.135 --> 38:36.856
that you like her,

1105
38:37.135 --> 38:37.776
and that

1106
38:39.016 --> 38:39.695
meeting her

1107
38:39.776 --> 38:40.896
was the luckiest thing.

1108
38:41.135 --> 38:42.215
Go to Jiangzhou with her.

1109
38:43.735 --> 38:44.615
Are you crazy?

1110
38:47.416 --> 38:48.215
What are you doing?

1111
38:49.496 --> 38:50.215
What are you doing?

1112
38:52.416 --> 38:52.816
Give it to me.

1113
38:53.376 --> 38:53.976
Hui.

1114
38:54.175 --> 38:54.535
Give it to me.

1115
38:55.856 --> 38:56.496
Go.

1116
39:12.296 --> 39:13.735
Do you have anything to say to me?

1117
39:15.336 --> 39:15.976
See you in Jiangzhou.

1118
39:37.896 --> 39:38.376
Hui.

1119
39:40.336 --> 39:41.215
Give me some time.

1120
39:43.016 --> 39:44.135
Once I get enough money,

1121
39:44.535 --> 39:45.336
I'll come back for you.

1122
39:45.695 --> 39:46.296
Four years.

1123
39:48.135 --> 39:49.336
I can only wait four years.

1124
39:51.496 --> 39:52.535
In four years,

1125
39:53.376 --> 39:54.695
our son will be off to college.

1126
39:55.816 --> 39:56.655
He'll figure it out.

1127
39:58.655 --> 39:59.175
Okay.

1128
40:01.456 --> 40:02.416
Once he recovers,

1129
40:03.615 --> 40:04.695
go abroad with him.

1130
40:05.776 --> 40:07.135
Don't worry about the money.

1131
40:08.416 --> 40:09.535
I'll get it to you.

1132
40:09.936 --> 40:10.695
Just remember.

1133
40:12.896 --> 40:14.016
I lent you out.

1134
40:17.456 --> 40:18.655
We are the real family.

1135
40:20.615 --> 40:21.175
I know.

1136
40:22.175 --> 40:22.776
Four years.

1137
40:25.735 --> 40:26.655
You promise?

1138
40:33.976 --> 40:34.655
I promise.

1139
40:38.416 --> 40:38.976
Meng.

1140
40:39.296 --> 40:40.055
(One year ago, Jiangzhou) You're back?

1141
40:40.336 --> 40:40.776
Yeah.

1142
40:41.296 --> 40:41.776
The agency

1143
40:41.976 --> 40:43.296
recommended a caregiver to me.

1144
40:43.615 --> 40:45.255
They said she's trained in nursing

1145
40:45.615 --> 40:47.135
and has experience with my condition.

1146
40:47.535 --> 40:48.255
Take a look.

1147
40:49.376 --> 40:49.856
Let me see.

1148
40:50.496 --> 40:51.496
What is your name again?

1149
40:52.095 --> 40:52.695
Lu Hui.

1150
40:57.576 --> 40:59.644
(Employment Registration Form)

1151
40:59.816 --> 41:00.255
Honey,

1152
41:00.936 --> 41:01.695
what a coincidence.

1153
41:02.095 --> 41:02.976
You're from the same place.

1154
41:04.655 --> 41:05.095
Yeah.

1155
41:05.776 --> 41:06.215
Lu Hui.

1156
41:06.896 --> 41:07.896
How long did you work

1157
41:07.936 --> 41:08.976
for the previous employer?

1158
41:09.856 --> 41:10.296
Four years.

1159
41:10.776 --> 41:12.175
That's quite a long time.

1160
41:13.016 --> 41:13.416
Yeah.

1161
41:14.856 --> 41:16.016
Four years is quite long.

1162
41:21.872 --> 41:25.095
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1163
41:25.095 --> 41:26.856
I kept looking for his mistresses,

1164
41:27.615 --> 41:28.416
only to realize

1165
41:28.936 --> 41:29.816
I was one of them.

1166
41:30.215 --> 41:31.735
Why did you let Lu Hui move in?

1167
41:32.255 --> 41:33.776
I let her in

1168
41:33.936 --> 41:34.776
to watch them

1169
41:34.856 --> 41:35.896
up close.

1170
41:36.016 --> 41:37.695
You're so outstanding.

1171
41:37.896 --> 41:38.575
Didn't anyone

1172
41:38.615 --> 41:39.936
