1173
41:40.575 --> 41:43.695
to any pretty teachers

1174
41:43.936 --> 41:45.416
or nurses?

1175
41:45.695 --> 41:46.615
He said he'd

1176
41:46.735 --> 41:47.976
make the money back in five years.

1177
41:48.776 --> 41:51.135
Besides, real estate holds its value.

1178
41:51.376 --> 41:52.095
We can

1179
41:52.336 --> 41:52.856
leave it

1180
41:52.896 --> 41:53.776
to our child.

1181
41:54.016 --> 41:55.255
Mr. Di is so thoughtful.

1182
41:56.575 --> 41:57.215
Ms. Hui.

1183
42:09.544 --> 42:12.976
♪We are broken butterflies♪

1184
42:13.253 --> 42:16.108
♪Can't fly beyond the boundary of fate♪

1185
42:16.477 --> 42:19.305
♪Wings torn apart by the night♪

1186
